@obverse
1. DIŠ# KA₂ E₂.GAL 2 ta-aš-ni-in-tum {giš}GU.ZA {giš#}GU#.ZA# x# x# [...]
# Glassner 2009: 61 reconstructs [i-ša-na-an]. The sign remains after ZA look more like A.

2. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL 2-ma bi-ri-šu-nu qu₂-u₂-um ṣa-bi-it# SUKKAL ir-ba-am i#-[ka-al]

3. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL 2-ma ri-it-ku-bu-u₂ SUKKAL i-na {giš}GU.ZA be-li-šu uš#-[ša-ab]

4. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL 2 3 ka-li-tum mar-tum šu-me-el ŠU.SI el-wi a-mu-ut [a-pi-ša-li-im] ša {m}na-ra-am-{d}ZUEN ik-mu-u₂-[šu]

5. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL ka-a-a-nu-um ka-a-a-nu-um ma-ta-nu-um i-na A₂.ZI ša-[ki-in]
6. {lu₂#}KUR₂-rum E₂.GAL-ka i-re-de-e bu-uš ma-ti-ka {lu₂}KUR₂-rum i-[ka-al]

7. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL ka-a-a-nu-um ka-a-a-nu-um-ma ša-nu-um i-na A₂.GUB₃# [ša-ki-in]
8. E₂.GAL {lu₂}KUR₂-ka te-re-de-e bu-uš ma-at {lu₂}KUR₂-ka# ta#-[ka-al]

9. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL ka-a-a-nu-um ka-a-a-nu-um-ma ša-nu-um EGIR a-[mu-tim ša-ki-in]
10. bu-uš ma-ti-i-ka a-na ma-at {lu₂}KUR₂-ka uṣ-ṣi-[i]

11. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL 3 i₃-li₂ ma-tim E₂.GAL-lam i-re-ed-du#-[u₂]

12. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL 4 a-mu-ut {m}i-bi-{d}ZUEN ša ša-ah-lu-uq#-[tim]

13. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL šu-uq-qu₂-ma ša-ki-in bu-uš ma-at {lu₂}KUR₂#-ka# [a-na ma-ti]-i#-ka i-ru-ba-[am]

14. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL ne₂-pe-el-ku-u₂ hu-ša-ah-hu-um ib-ba-aš-ši-[i]

15. DIŠ# KA₂# E₂.GAL ṣu₂-ul-lu-ul ṣi-li₂ DINGIR-lim e-li LU₂-lim ib-ba-aš-ši-i#

@reverse

1. [DIŠ] KA₂# E₂.GAL pa-ar-ki-iš e-ṣe-er {lu₂}KUR₂-rum u₂-ši-ri-ba-am-ma i-na lib₃-bi# ma#-ti-ka# ša-la-tam u₂-ši-iṣ-ṣe-e

2. DIŠ KA₂ E₂.GAL ši-rum i-bi-ir a#-mu#-ut {d}ŠUL.GI ša {m}tap-pa₂{pa}-an-da-ra-ah ik-mu-u₂

3. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu-um ru-uš-šu-uk lu-mu-un lib₃-bi

4. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu lu-uʾ-ʾu₅-ma e-le-nu-um u₃ ša-ap-la-nu-um ši-ra-am! i-ku-ul
5. šar-ra-am i-na lib₃-bi KA₂ E₂.GAL-šu i-du-uk-ku-u₂-šu

6. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu ṣa-bi-it-ma u₃ da-a-an aš-qu₂-la-al# ša-me-e-em
7. i-na ku-uṣ-ṣi ku-uṣ-ṣu ib-ba-aš-ši i-na um-me-a-tim um-šum ib-ba-aš-ši

8. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu ṣu₂-ru-uš u₄-mu-um i-ru-pa-am-ma ša-mu-um i-za-nu-un

9. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu lu-uʾ-ʾu₅ hi-ši₂-im-ma-tim a-na E₂.GAL-lim i-ru-ub

10. DIŠ i-na KA₂ E₂.GAL si₂-hu lu-uʾ-ʾu₅#-ma# u₃# iš#-qa₂-la-al mi-lum i-la-ka-[am]
11. ša-nu-um šum-šu za-na-an ša#-me#-e#-em a-ka-al ša-al-la-tim

